The singleton and binary join maps into the powerdomain are approximable, and the binary join is computable.

<!-- formalization -->

**Theorem (`PDsingleton_mono`).** As set out for this part of the library.

*Proof.* By the relation of the join map to the two singleton maps and the computable presentation of the powerdomain. ∎

